 for many years and always loved your design books. I loved your desert designs! I feel so lucky to get to send a skeb to you! \n\nReference of the Poneko: https://imgur.com/a/8sioAcl Her personality is impish, mischievous, and cheerful. She is a radioactive catgirl. Feel free to change her hairstyle if you'd like, just keep the hair color and cat ears please. \n\nI love your style and your designs!\nIf the amount is not enough, please resend.\n\nIf I like the design I'd like to potentially use it as a new outfit for Poneko! It has always been my dream to have an outfit designed by you!\n\nThank you!\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/8sioAcl", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 700579, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "cam （きゃむ）", "screen_name": "cammero95713700", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1273806512943583232/tAk3enKM.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1043840318989189120/1594423565/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "banned": false, "nc": 129}, {"id": 770478, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "606noir", "screen_name": "606noir", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1571054940789043200/qQj2ce-y.png", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/207588007/1644853203/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 6, "complete_expiration_days": 30, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 1}, {"id": 1650340, "creator":